Application", "id": "27141950195420085", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "34412333785048320"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3603386033288714"}]}, "change_log": "New Features:\n\nAdded thumbnail shimmer loading effect while API requests are in progress.\nAdded video thumbnail preview on hover in the Info Panel.\nAdded page jump input for quick navigation.\nAdded additional tooltips across the UI.\nAdded control stick navigation while the Info Panel is open.\nAdded passthrough support for flat videos.\nAdded render scale setting for the app and video player.\nAdded Graphics Quality selector.\nAdded virtual environment support in the video player.\nAdded display bend presets for flat videos and images.\nAdded Swap Eyes option (Advanced Settings \u2192 Video Adjustments).\nAdded support for viewing local images and DLNA images.\nAdded stereo mode and stereo packing controls for images.\nAdded image icons in File Explorer.\nAdded Graphics Quality and Personalize sections in Settings.\nAdded main and video player gamepad control maps.\nImproved controller detection for active gamepads.\nImproved stick behavior to prevent scrolling and zoom conflicts.\n\nUI Improvements:\n\nReworked Info Panel overlay.\nReworked global keyboard.\nUpdated Local Playback layout with large icons.\n\nGraphics:\n\nAdded animated skybox.\nOptimized shaders to prevent image viewing crashes.\n\nFixes:\n\nFixed AB Loop.\nFixed hidden control panel buttons remaining interactive.\nFixed initial position issues with room-scale boundaries.\nImproved passthrough stability.\nFixed stick conflicts between scrolling, zoom and pitch.\nFixed HLS settings visibility on Windows.\nFixed navigation issue when returning from video to DLNA.\nAdded login error messages from API.\nUpdated AVPro to 3.3.1\n\nPlatform:\n\nUpdated OpenXR dependencies.\nDowngraded Meta OpenXR SDK for improved stabi